# Admin · 成长记录（依赖先登录，见 ../_login.http）

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/growth/logs?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 详情（:id 换为实际日志 ID）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/growth/logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 审核
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/growth/logs/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "pass",
  "remark": "内容合规，审核通过"
}

### 删除
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/growth/logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 统计（可选 start_date + end_date，须同时传或同时不传）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/growth/stats?start_date=2026-03-01&end_date=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
